?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:11:02+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FsW12RhqCmlM0dWnpw7bu7Vzv1pSv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fi6rsDAVc7JNc4WgsgsTJZEoQg36v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af9522f136b2761c67b94e2","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"https://weclaw.im 新版本发布了。定位是：Personal Agent 扫码直接聊，闲聊、干活都行，微信、Telegram 快速接入 - 可以接入自己的设备，指挥本地 Agent 干活 - 可以通过连接器挂载私有数据，查邮件、记笔记都行 - 可以定制角色，跟不同性格的 Agent 对话 - 可以跟主 Agent 对话，调度其他 Agent 来协作 - 可以接入自己的 Skills，…","body":"https://weclaw.im 新版本发布了。定位是：Personal Agent\n\n扫码直接聊，闲聊、干活都行，微信、Telegram 快速接入\n\n- 可以接入自己的设备，指挥本地 Agent 干活\n\n- 可以通过连接器挂载私有数据，查邮件、记笔记都行\n\n- 可以定制角色，跟不同性格的 Agent 对话\n\n- 可以跟主 Agent 对话，调度其他 Agent 来协作\n\n- 可以接入自己的 Skills，实现自定义工作流\n\nvs Grok Bot / Muse:\n\n1. 扫码直接用，在微信、TG 对话框使用更高频\n\n2. 定制自己的角色，设置不同的性格和灵魂，活人感更强\n\n3. 连接自己的电脑，使用本地 Agent（codex、claude 等），复用订阅更方便\n\n欢迎使用。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af9522f136b2761c67b94e2","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmrfKNhxyAmSwh8qYtJQhvzhaBnIv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:33:19+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform